{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01869","headline":"杂曲歌辞 枯鱼过河泣 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 枯鱼过河泣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白龙改常服，偶被豫且制。\n谁使尔爲鱼，徒劳诉天帝。\n作书报鲸鲵，勿恃风涛势。\n涛落归泥沙，翻遭蝼蚁噬。\n万乘慎出入，柏人以爲诫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01869.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01869","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}